WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:10,630
so beautiful

2
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:11,910
No jumping allowed

3
00:00:11,910 --> 00:00:14,350
Be careful to disturb others

4
00:00:14,750 --> 00:00:22,700
If you touch it, you won’t grow taller.

5
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:26,010
Why is my sister a boy?

6
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:30,130
Because she is your brother, why don’t you tell me to go away if I go?

7
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:52,990
Things in my recent dreams

8
00:00:53,190 --> 00:00:54,430
When I wake up, I forget most of it

9
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:57,560
Say the rest

10
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:59,360
It will only make everyone more worried

11
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:06,430
I still can't find any news from the north, but I believe it

12
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:08,070
My hometown will be safe
